after tomorrow.

622
00:30:24,020 --> 00:30:25,459
I’ll get to talk to you then.

623
00:30:29,233 --> 00:30:30,568
You wanted to talk to me?

624
00:30:31,527 --> 00:30:33,696
You mean you wanted to talk to me?

625
00:30:34,322 --> 00:30:35,322
About what?

626
00:30:35,698 --> 00:30:37,241
Ah, I mean—

627
00:30:38,326 --> 00:30:39,326
