628
00:30:41,245 --> 00:30:42,997
No. I just—

629
00:30:43,539 --> 00:30:45,541
I wanted to apologize

630
00:30:45,541 --> 00:30:47,627
for how my brothers acted.

631
00:30:48,711 --> 00:30:51,964
And I also want to say sorry

632
00:30:51,964 --> 00:30:54,095
for inviting you to the house right away.

633
00:30:55,510 --> 00:30:58,346
I don’t even know how
to make it up to you.

634
00:30:58,346 --> 00:30:59,972
So I’m really sorry.

635
00:31:01,349 --> 00:31:02,809
No, it’s nothing. Forget about it.

636
00:31:03,768 --> 00:31:05,520
But if you want to make it up to me,

637
00:31:06,854 --> 00:31:08,481
let’s just go on another date.

638
00:31:11,984 --> 00:31:12,984
A date?

639
00:31:15,405 --> 00:31:16,585
Of course!

640
00:31:17,573 --> 00:31:18,574
I hope

641
00:31:19,701 --> 00:31:21,160
