650
00:31:42,473 --> 00:31:46,144
Don’t worry. I’ll make our date special.

651
00:31:49,605 --> 00:31:50,605
Thank you, Ngo.

652
00:31:51,524 --> 00:31:52,524
You’re welcome.

653
00:32:01,409 --> 00:32:02,660
Wow!

654
00:32:09,333 --> 00:32:11,461
