- Yes.

657
00:32:15,339 --> 00:32:16,007
Thank you!

658
00:32:16,007 --> 00:32:17,300
- Alright.
- there, there.

659
00:32:17,300 --> 00:32:18,301
You can check the phone.

660
00:32:18,301 --> 00:32:19,719
Okay. Count the money.

661
00:32:20,011 --> 00:32:23,931
Oh wow, my son’s going to be so happy.

662
00:32:25,600 --> 00:32:27,935
