663
00:32:31,481 --> 00:32:33,941
Look, my phone’s the oldest model.

664
00:33:05,097 --> 00:33:08,184
Okay! That’s my expertise.

665
00:33:09,310 --> 00:33:11,062
I’ll come up with a great menu.

666
00:33:11,062 --> 00:33:12,230
Like what?

667
00:33:12,230 --> 00:33:13,940
- Complete.
- Complete?

668
00:33:13,940 --> 00:33:18,152
From appetizer to main course to dessert.

669
00:33:18,152 --> 00:33:20,571
- Nice!
- Wow!

670
00:33:20,571 --> 00:33:21,948
Make it really good, okay?

671
00:33:21,948 --> 00:33:23,574
Like, really delicious!

672
00:33:23,574 --> 00:33:24,825
Can I request

673
00:33:24,825 --> 00:33:26,702
