674
00:33:26,702 --> 00:33:28,162
Menudo, adobo…

675
00:33:28,162 --> 00:33:31,165
But for the caldereta, add lots of cheese!

676
00:33:31,165 --> 00:33:32,583
Lots of cheese!

677
00:33:32,583 --> 00:33:33,584
Yeah!

678
00:33:33,584 --> 00:33:34,669
What’s that?

679
00:33:34,669 --> 00:33:35,669
Cheese!

680
00:33:35,878 --> 00:33:36,921
The cheese!

681
00:33:36,921 --> 00:33:39,215
Cheese!

682
00:33:41,008 --> 00:33:42,885
I'll take care of the videoke.

683
00:33:43,844 --> 00:33:45,054
Just one word with Kap,

684
00:33:45,054 --> 00:33:46,764
- I gotchu!
- Oh, wow!

685
00:33:46,764 --> 00:33:49,809
Captain's favorite!

686
00:33:49,809 --> 00:33:54,355
- Do everything!
- As for me, I'll prepare other things.

687
00:33:54,355 --> 00:33:57,275
- Like what?
- The lights, the flowers...

688
00:33:57,275 --> 00:33:58,401
- Wow!
- Which colors?

689
00:33:58,401 --> 00:33:59,569
You have to do that, okay?

690
00:33:59,569 --> 00:34:01,070
I’m counting on you.

691
00:34:01,070 --> 00:34:03,197
Mimi, don’t let me down.

692
00:34:03,197 --> 00:34:04,740
- Of course!
- Don't let me down.

693
00:34:04,740 --> 00:34:06,701
We'll take care of their date, right?

694
00:34:32,268 --> 00:34:33,519
Damn you guys!

695
00:34:36,188 --> 00:34:38,065
You bunch of harelips!

696
00:34:38,190 --> 00:34:40,151
And you’re talking while eating?

697
00:34:41,569 --> 00:34:44,155
I can’t understand anything, okay?

698
00:34:44,655 --> 00:34:45,948
I didn’t get anything!

699
00:34:46,198 --> 00:34:47,199
Did you think—

700
00:34:47,992 --> 00:34:49,076
