701
00:34:49,327 --> 00:34:50,786
Do you see any subtitles here?

702
00:34:52,747 --> 00:34:54,624
- Sit down!
- I can’t understand anything!

703
00:34:54,624 --> 00:34:57,043
Sit down. Breathe! Breathe! Breathe!

704
00:34:58,127 --> 00:34:59,127
Wait, okay.

705
00:34:59,253 --> 00:35:00,671
There are no subtitles here, okay?

706
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:02,298
Okay?

707
00:35:02,298 --> 00:35:04,050
Okay, that’s enough.

708
00:35:04,967 --> 00:35:06,010
Just think of it this way—

709
00:35:06,636 --> 00:35:09,972
