712
00:35:15,269 --> 00:35:16,395
I’ve got it covered.

713
00:35:16,647 --> 00:35:18,983
Okay, okay! Let’s move! Move!

714
00:35:19,023 --> 00:35:21,942
- Don't you trust me?
- No! No. I trust you.

715
00:35:21,942 --> 00:35:23,361
Okay, let’s move.

716
00:35:23,361 --> 00:35:25,363
- Let’s go.
- Grab that thing.

717
00:35:25,363 --> 00:35:26,405
- I’ve got you, okay?
- Thank you.

718
00:35:26,405 --> 00:35:27,740
