730
00:35:54,266 --> 00:35:57,228
Sorry, but I really can’t understand
people with a cleft.

731
00:35:58,972 --> 00:35:59,997
I’ll buy.

732
00:36:00,022 --> 00:36:02,358
I’m buying. I have money. I’ll buy.

733
