736
00:36:10,800 --> 00:36:13,345
Because the two of us won’t
understand each other. I’m really sorry.

737
00:36:13,369 --> 00:36:15,287
Wow! Wow! Wow!

738
00:36:15,287 --> 00:36:17,039
- Why?
- My friend’s normal?

739
00:36:17,206 --> 00:36:18,708
