740
00:36:18,808 --> 00:36:19,975
- Huh?
- I’m abnormal?

741
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,168
- Huh?
- Abnormal?

742
00:36:21,168 --> 00:36:22,002
Huh? I really…

743
00:36:22,027 --> 00:36:24,405
Sorry. I really don’t understand what
you’re saying.

744
00:36:24,630 --> 00:36:27,591
I don’t understand anything. Sorry.
I’m really sorry.

745
00:36:28,134 --> 00:36:29,635
You should just buy somewhere else.

746
00:36:29,735 --> 00:36:31,946
No! I’m buying here.
I’m already here.

747
00:36:31,971 --> 00:36:34,181
- Let me buy.
- Let’s try, okay?

748
00:36:34,432 --> 00:36:35,683
But don’t get your hopes up.

749
00:36:36,117 --> 00:36:37,827
Still, we’ll try. Okay?

750
00:36:37,852 --> 00:36:39,603
- Alright.
- Okay, go.

751
00:36:39,603 --> 00:36:40,603
Game.

752
00:36:41,366 --> 00:36:42,415
I want to buy.

753
00:36:42,440 --> 00:36:44,316
- Buy what?
- Softdrink.

754
00:36:44,316 --> 00:36:45,318
This is what I was talking about.

755
00:36:45,342 --> 00:36:46,761
Damn it.

756
00:36:47,253 --> 00:36:49,964
- Nyokning.
- Softdrink.

757
00:36:49,989 --> 00:36:51,031
I’m buying a softdrink.

758
00:36:51,056 --> 00:36:52,808
Toothpick?

759
00:36:52,833 --> 00:36:53,868
Softdrink!

760
00:36:53,868 --> 00:36:56,746
Nyokning. O-ink, O-ink, O-ink?

761
00:36:56,746 --> 00:36:57,913
Ballpen ink?

762
00:36:57,913 --> 00:36:59,665
- Ink?
- Softdrink.

763
00:36:59,665 --> 00:37:00,916
Oh, here. Softdrink.

764
00:37:00,941 --> 00:37:01,942
Bottle.

765
00:37:02,334 --> 00:37:03,419
With a cap.

766
00:37:03,419 --> 00:37:05,086
Sweet potato?
You open it.

767
00:37:05,171 --> 00:37:06,714
Then put a straw.

768
00:37:07,214 --> 00:37:08,214
Then you drink it.

769
00:37:08,799 --> 00:37:10,217
Like that. Softdrink.

770
00:37:10,217 --> 00:37:11,719
- Hopia?
- Softdrink!

771
00:37:11,719 --> 00:37:13,304
I’m buying a softdrink.

772
00:37:13,304 --> 00:37:16,724
- I can’t—
- Here. I’m buying a softdrink! Um—

773
00:37:16,724 --> 00:37:18,224
- Sputnik?
- Here, here.

774
00:37:18,267 --> 00:37:19,267
Mountain Dew.

775
00:37:19,352 --> 00:37:21,354
- Mountain Dew.
- I don’t know about you.

776
00:37:21,812 --> 00:37:23,582
- Mountain Dew.
- I don’t know about you either.

777
00:37:23,606 --> 00:37:24,982
- Mountain Dew.
- I don’t know about you either.

778
00:37:24,982 --> 00:37:26,358
- Mountain Dew.
- I don’t know about you either.

779
00:37:26,358 --> 00:37:27,777
I’m buying Mountain Dew.

780
00:37:27,777 --> 00:37:29,236
You keep saying “I don’t know about you.”

781
00:37:29,236 --> 00:37:30,279
But that’s what you’re telling me.

782
00:37:30,279 --> 00:37:31,405
I already don’t understand.

783
00:37:31,405 --> 00:37:32,782
I don’t understand anything.

784
00:37:32,807 --> 00:37:34,558
Ah. This is easier.

785
00:37:35,659 --> 00:37:36,659
Pepsi.

786
00:37:36,994 --> 00:37:37,994
Pepsi.

787
00:37:38,287 --> 00:37:40,581
I’m buying a softdrink. Pepsi.

788
